PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: So, you've finally arrived.\n"
    .string "I've been waiting, {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "Every step I took, every battle I\n"
    .string "fought… it was all for this moment.\p"
    .string "I stopped chasing shadows and\n"
    .string "started looking inward.\p"
    .string "I'm not the same person you met\n"
    .string "back in Pallet Town.\p"
    .string "I am the POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION,\n"
    .string "and I've earned this throne.\p"
    .string "Show me the strength that brought\n"
    .string "you here. Don't hold back!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Back for more, {PLAYER}?\n"
    .string "Good. I was getting restless.\p"
    .string "The title of CHAMPION isn't just\n"
    .string "a crown—it's a weight.\p"
    .string "I've spent every day since our\n"
    .string "last battle refining my soul.\p"
    .string "My team and I… we are one now.\p"
    .string "Come, {PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "Let's show them a battle that\l"
    .string "history will never forget!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "I see…\n"
    .string "So this is the answer I was\l"
    .string "looking for.\p"
    .string "Even at my absolute limit,\n"
    .string "your light shines brighter.\p"
    .string "It hurts… but for the first time,\n"
    .string "it feels right.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Victory::
    .string "はーはッ！\n"
    .string "かった！　かった！　かった！\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}に　まける　ような\n"
    .string "おれさま　では　なーい！\p"
    .string "ま！　ポケモンの\n"
    .string "てんさい　{RIVAL}さま　あいてに\l"
    .string "ここまで　よく　がんばった！\p"
    .string "ほめて　つかわす！\n"
    .string "はーッ！　はーはッはッ！$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "{RIVAL}: I understand now.\p"
    .string "I tried to reach the top by\n"
    .string "pushing everyone else down.\p"
    .string "But you… you reached out your\n"
    .string "hand and climbed with them.\p"
    .string "Congratulations, {PLAYER}.\n"
    .string "You truly are the CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "I have a new path to find now…$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayer::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakCongratulations::
    .string "OAK: So, you've won!\n"
    .string "Sincerely, congratulations!\p"
    .string "You're the new POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
    .string "CHAMPION!\p"
    .string "You've grown up so much since you\n"
    .string "first left with {STR_VAR_1} to work\l"
    .string "on the POKéDEX.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}, you have come of age!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakImDisappointedRival::
    .string "OAK: {RIVAL}…\p"
    .string "I came as soon as I heard you\n"
    .string "had conquered the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "To see you lose so quickly…\n"
    .string "it must be a heavy blow.\p"
    .string "But tell me, {RIVAL}…\n"
    .string "Did you feel it this time?\p"
    .string "The heartbeat of your team\n"
    .string "echoing your own?\p"
    .string "You've lost the title, but you've\n"
    .string "found something far greater.\p"
    .string "Don't ever let that go again.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayerComeWithMe::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "You understand that your victory\n"
    .string "was not just your own doing.\p"
    .string "The bond you share with your\n"
    .string "POKéMON is marvelous.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "Come with me!$"

